      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Atomium, a 103‑meter‑tall structure built for Expo 58, stands on the Heysel Plateau and remains a symbol of modernist architecture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
